--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Reference data redistributed inside this package
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Epoch AI -- AI Capabilities Index benchmark data
    https://epoch.ai/data/eci_benchmarks.csv
    Licence: Creative Commons Attribution (CC-BY)

    Benchmark scores in src/llmverify/reference/data/reference.yaml whose
    `source` field reads "Epoch AI Capabilities Index" are derived from this
    dataset. They cover GPQA Diamond, ARC-AGI-1, ARC-AGI-2, SimpleQA Verified,
    HLE, CritPt, FrontierMath, OTIS Mock AIME, SWE-Bench Verified, Terminal
    Bench, Aider polyglot, MMLU, MATH level 5, BBH and GSM8K. The CC-BY licence
    permits this redistribution; the credit it requires is this notice.
    `llmverify refresh --source epoch` re-reads the same file.

Artificial Analysis -- intelligence, coding and agentic index values
    https://artificialanalysis.ai/
    Terms: Artificial Analysis's own terms of use.

    Scores in the snapshot under the benchmark keys `aa_intelligence_index`,
    `aa_coding_index` and `aa_agentic_index` originate with Artificial Analysis
    and reach this package through OpenRouter's public model API, which embeds
    them. They are attributed to Artificial Analysis rather than to OpenRouter,
    with the source field "Artificial Analysis, relayed by OpenRouter". The
    Artificial Analysis API itself is not called; it requires a key.

OpenRouter -- public model and endpoint API
    https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/models
    https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/models/{author}/{slug}/endpoints

    Model identifiers, context lengths, per-token pricing and per-provider
    self-declared quantization labels are read from OpenRouter's documented
    public API, which requires no key. Only that API is used; the website is
    not scraped. Requests are made at refresh cadence, one at a time.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Evaluation datasets fetched at runtime
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

None of these are redistributed in this repository. They are fetched on demand
over the HuggingFace datasets-server REST API and cached under the user's cache
directory. Each remains under its own licence, and using a benchmark through
llmverify does not change the terms you accepted from its publisher.

MIT
    basicv8vc/SimpleQA           -- source of the items used by the
                                    `simpleqa_verified` benchmark
    TIGER-Lab/MMLU-Pro           -- source of the MMLU-Pro probe items

unverified
    HuggingFaceH4/aime_2024      -- source of the AIME 2024 probe items. The
                                    dataset card carries no licence tag, so
                                    llmverify reports the licence as
                                    "unverified" rather than assuming one.

cc-by-4.0
    Idavidrein/gpqa              -- source of the GPQA Diamond probe items.
                                    Gated: it requires an accepted licence and
                                    an HF token, and its terms ask that items
                                    not be republished in plaintext. llmverify
                                    caches items locally and never emits them
                                    into a report.

cc-by-nc-sa-4.0
    MathArena/aime_2026          -- source of the AIME 2026 probe items
    MathArena/aime_2025          -- source of the AIME 2025 probe items
                                    Non-commercial: check this against your own
                                    use before running these two benchmarks in
                                    a commercial audit.

apache-2.0
    google/IFEval                -- source of the IFEval probe items

The `synthetic` benchmark is generated locally and carries no third-party
licence.

